%% Vedant Admin (Android) — key call flows (sequence diagrams)
%% Extracted from docs/ARCHITECTURE.md. These are the flows that must never fake success.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as SplashScreen
    participant VM as SplashViewModel
    participant Auth as AuthRepositoryImpl
    participant SB as Supabase Auth
    participant RPC as RPC is_admin()

    UI->>VM: onCreate / restore()
    VM->>VM: state = Unknown (spinner)
    VM->>Auth: restoreSession()
    Auth->>SB: autoLoadFromStorage (persisted refresh token)
    alt no session
        SB-->>Auth: no session
        Auth-->>VM: Outcome.Success(AdminIdentity(isAdmin=false, no user))
        VM-->>UI: SessionState.SignedOut
    else session present
        SB-->>Auth: session(userId, email)
        Auth->>RPC: is_admin()
        alt 42501 / false
            RPC-->>Auth: false
            Auth-->>VM: Outcome.Success(AdminIdentity(isAdmin=false))
            VM-->>UI: SessionState.NotAuthorized
        else true
            RPC-->>Auth: true
            Auth-->>VM: Outcome.Success(AdminIdentity(isAdmin=true))
            VM-->>UI: SessionState.SignedIn
        end
    end
    Note over UI: NavHost guard routes on SessionState.<br/>Never a locally cached role.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as OrderDetailScreen
    participant VM as OrderDetailViewModel
    participant Repo as OrderRepositoryImpl
    participant RPC as RPC admin_update_order_status
    participant PG as Postgres (state machine)

    UI->>VM: onAccept()  // user taps "Confirm"
    VM->>VM: action = InFlight  (button spinner, double-submit blocked)
    VM->>Repo: updateStatus(orderId, CONFIRMED, reason=null)
    Repo->>RPC: admin_update_order_status(orderId, 'CONFIRMED', null)
    RPC->>PG: private.order_transition_allowed(from,to)?
    alt transition illegal
        PG-->>RPC: raise 22023 "cannot move ..."
        RPC-->>Repo: RestException(22023)
        Repo-->>VM: Outcome.Failure(AppError.Validation)
        VM->>VM: action = Failed ; order UNCHANGED
        VM-->>UI: show mapped copy ; status does NOT move
    else not admin
        PG-->>RPC: raise 42501
        Repo-->>VM: Outcome.Failure(AppError.Unauthorized)
        VM-->>UI: "You don't have permission..." ; no change
    else allowed
        PG-->>RPC: ok (history + notify written)
        RPC-->>Repo: ok
        Repo->>Repo: getOrder(orderId)  // RE-FETCH server row
        Repo-->>VM: Outcome.Success(Order)  // server-confirmed status + totals
        VM->>VM: action = Idle ; order = server row
        VM-->>UI: render exactly the server result
    end

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as RejectItemSheet
    participant VM as OrderDetailViewModel
    participant Repo as OrderRepositoryImpl
    participant RPC as RPC admin_reject_order_item
    participant PG as Postgres (money rules)

    UI->>VM: onRejectItem(itemId, reason)
    VM->>VM: action = InFlight  (submit disabled)
    VM->>Repo: rejectItem(itemId, reason)
    Repo->>RPC: admin_reject_order_item(itemId, reason)
    Note over RPC,PG: NO amount is ever sent by the client.
    RPC->>PG: recompute adjustment_amount (<=0) and final_total
    alt item already rejected / order terminal
        PG-->>RPC: raise 22023
        Repo-->>VM: Outcome.Failure(AppError.Validation)
        VM-->>UI: show copy ; totals UNCHANGED
    else ok
        PG-->>RPC: ok  original_total / adjustment_amount / final_total
        Repo->>Repo: getOrder(orderId)
        Repo-->>VM: Outcome.Success(Order)  // server-computed final_total
        VM-->>UI: render final_total verbatim (never locally computed)
    end
